    <briefdescription>
<para>Accumulated force and moment vectors from a <ref refid="classNeoFOAM_1_1Forces" kindref="compound">Forces</ref> execution. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Both pressure and viscous force/moment slots are populated by execute(): the pressure contribution from the boundary pressure field and the viscous contribution from the wall shear stress (gradU-based, including turbulent nut when present). </para>
